                <mxCell id="dept_kb" value="&lt;b&gt;Department Knowledge Base&lt;/b&gt;
knowledge/sources/*.yaml — Source-Metadaten (nicht Runtime-Queries)
knowledge/policies/*.yaml — Required Fields, Evidence-Minima, Gate-Regeln
knowledge/query_strategies/*.yaml — Runtime Query-Templates (single authority)
query_resolver.py — Placeholder-Expansion · Validierung · Buyer-Expansion
Guidance only — Department-Konversation bleibt frei" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#ea580c;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontColor=#7c2d12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="790" width="440" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
