decision: accepted / accepted_with_gaps / rejected
raw_package (immer) · admitted_payload (wenn nicht rejected)
downstream_visible = decision != rejected" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontColor=#1e3a8a;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="1080" width="440" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rc" value="&lt;b&gt;⬡ Resolution Controller&lt;/b&gt;  (eigene Komponente)
ResolutionController.classify() nach erstem Department-Round
Prioritätsreihenfolge → genau ein Bucket:
BLOCKING_FAILURE          → blockiert sofort
AUTO_CLOSE_REQUIRED       → run_bounded_follow_up()
USER_DECISION_REQUIRED    → Dashboard Pause
CUSTOMER_CONFIRMATION     → accept gap, weiter
NOT_MEETING_CRITICAL      → direkt zur Synthesis" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e0e7ff;strokeColor=#4338ca;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontColor=#312e81;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="1200" width="440" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
                <mxCell id="auto_close" value="&lt;b&gt;Auto-Close Bounded Follow-Up&lt;/b&gt;
run_bounded_follow_up() · max 4 öffentliche Gap-Fragen
resolved_question_ids → Answer Matrix update
mapping_missing Flag wenn keine question_ids vorhanden" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e0e7ff;strokeColor=#4338ca;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontColor=#312e81;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="1380" width="440" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
                <mxCell id="dashboard" value="&lt;b&gt;Dashboard Pause / Resume&lt;/b&gt;
run_pipeline() → needs_user_selection
